// games/sonic4/test/poison/poison_tail_if_unit_fold.emp — POISON (see README).
//
// TARGETS: the ONE surface the engine has that catches EMP_PITFALLS §1's silent
// unit fold — a module-level value `ensure` over the folded samples.
// EXPECTED FRAGMENT: "TAIL_IF_UNIT_FOLD" (with both interpolated values quoted
// in the lane row: `()` for the broken shape, `-16` for the shipped generator).
//
// Background (triangle-fold parcel, 2026-08-26): `deform_triangle`'s original
// body ended its `comptime for` element in a block-tail `if`/`else`, which sigil
// folds to `()` for EVERY input with NO diagnostic (EMP_PITFALLS §1, measured
// here even though the `if` is not nested). Sigil cannot refuse the fold at the
// point of production, and the lane's `--extra-entry` contract refuses `data`
// declarations, so the OTHER catch surface — `pub data X: [i8; 256] = ...`
// emission dying with 256 x `[emit.type] expected an integer for i8, got unit`
// (measured against a reachable copy) — cannot be pinned from this directory.
// What CAN be pinned, and is pinned here, is that `() == int` compares FALSE
// rather than erroring, so a sample-pinning ensure catches a unit fold loudly.
// That is exactly the mechanism the module-level TriPin guards in
// engine/level/parallax_dsl.emp rely on; this poison is their proof-of-catch.
//
// tail_if_tri() below is a verbatim copy of the PRE-FIX generator body (the
// block-tail-if shape). The ensure compares its fold against the SHIPPED
// generator's, differentially:
//   - today: P[0] is `()`, F[0] is -16, the ensure fires — 1 diagnostic.
//   - if sigil ever fixes block-tail-if folding, P[0] becomes -16, this module
//     builds CLEAN, and the lane fails THIS case — the signal that §1's trap is
//     gone and this poison (plus the pitfall entry) should be retired, not that
//     something broke.
//
// Zero bytes, ensures-only — unreachable from any real entry like every module
// in this directory; evaluated only by tools/emp_expect_fail.py.
module games.sonic4.test.poison.poison_tail_if_unit_fold

// Verbatim pre-fix deform_triangle body: the element expression is an if/else
// in block-tail position of the `comptime for` body — §1's shape.
comptime fn tail_if_tri(amplitude: int, period: int) -> [i8; 256] {
    return comptime for i in 0..256 {
        if (i % period) < (period / 2) {
            (((i % period) * amplitude * 4) / period) - amplitude
        } else {
            amplitude - ((((i % period) - period / 2) * amplitude * 4) / period)
        }
    }
}

const P = tail_if_tri(amplitude: 16, period: 64)
const F = deform_triangle(amplitude: 16, period: 64)

ensure(P[0] == F[0],
       "TAIL_IF_UNIT_FOLD: the block-tail-if element folded P[0] to {P[0]} while the shipped generator folds {F[0]} — a value ensure is the engine's catch surface for EMP_PITFALLS section-1 unit folds; if P[0] just became a number, sigil fixed the fold and this poison should be RETIRED, see header")
